# HyperFrames video

- Standalone root: `#stage.clip` with `data-composition-id="keyloop"`, 1920x1080, 30fps.
- One paused GSAP timeline: `window.__timelines["keyloop"] = tl`.
- Use `gsap.fromTo`. Do not tween `visibility`/`autoAlpha` on `.clip`.
- Bundle local `vendor/gsap.min.js` and `@font-face` files. No CDN fonts.
